Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, we're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.98,0:00:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care. Cheer for us all while you're there.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.91,0:00:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.12,0:00:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-bu! Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.21,0:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Minami's big game! \NI have to be there!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't go, it'll be terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.87,0:00:33.43,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.27,0:00:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'm not really sure why it'd be terrible...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoaow!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.12,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll just get in the way. You promised you'd stay home and cheer Kaoru on today, remember?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.60,0:00:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Kosuke...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.43,0:00:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep being stubborn, \NI'll tell Keigo-san on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.15,0:00:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell my dad, Kosuke! \NOkay, I get it! I won't go cheer for Minami!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Then I won't tell Keigo-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.08,0:00:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Kosuke! Purr-purr...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.10,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Whoa there...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.40,0:01:04.63,Thought,,0,0,0,,Ever since Mio-chan heard Keigo-san was coming back from Hong Kong, she's been overjoyed.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.63,0:01:10.91,Thought,,0,0,0,,Then we got a call saying Kanna-san, the former dorm manager, would be coming back with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.91,0:01:15.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,She said she had something \Nimportant to tell Kosuke...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.83,Thought,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.83,0:01:20.34,Thought,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be that he's leaving... could it?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.34,0:01:27.76,Thought,,0,0,0,,No... it's not just Kosuke... If Kaoru-san doesn't pass her exam, she might have to go back to Kagoshima.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.76,0:01:29.47,Thought,,0,0,0,,And Minami-chan too...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.47,0:01:33.80,Thought,,0,0,0,,If she ends up going to a school that's too far to commute from here,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.80,0:01:37.18,Thought,,0,0,0,,we won't get to see each other \Nevery day anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.18,0:01:38.54,Thought,,0,0,0,,And Listhy, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.54,0:01:43.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,Mayuki said she's only staying at Sazanami while she's receiving treatment in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.08,0:01:47.05,Thought,,0,0,0,,So someday we'll have to say goodbye to her too.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.05,0:01:53.28,Thought,,0,0,0,,As well as to Mayuki, \NKaede-chan, Yuuhi-chan, Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.87,Thought,,0,0,0,,We can't all stay together forever, can we?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.27,0:02:02.29,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've hated winter ever since I was little.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.29,0:02:05.44,Thought,,0,0,0,,I hate the endless falling snow and the freezing wind.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.44,0:02:06.75,Thought,,0,0,0,,I hate winter...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.75,0:02:09.40,Thought,,0,0,0,,because it always feels like \Nsomeone's about to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Iena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.63,0:03:06.43,Thought,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Minami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Iena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.82,0:03:30.06,Thought,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.50,0:03:32.25,Thought,,0,0,0,,Okamoto, bring it on!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.46,0:03:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Final score: 54 to 53. \NTeam B wins!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! We did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.99,0:03:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.78,0:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.06,0:04:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally did it!\N We beat Rikako-san's team!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.11,0:04:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.83,0:04:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.95,0:04:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? I wanted so badly \Nto beat Rikako-san's team, and yet...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.48,0:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikako-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.93,0:04:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot out there. \NYou've really improved.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.48,0:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true... \NI'm still nowhere near good enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.26,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't get all timid now, {New }Captain.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.78,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.61,0:04:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No "huh." We all agreed you're \Nour new captain. No arguments.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.10,0:04:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I can't! There are people \Nway better suited than me, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.67,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do just fine, Okamoto.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.19,0:04:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it. I'm leaving \Nthe basketball club in your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikako-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.77,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can retire without worrying.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okamoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.31,0:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.27,0:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikako-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.65,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... You're such a crybaby. \NNow I'm starting to worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.78,0:04:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise... I promise... {??? zettai?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.51,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Don't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.61,0:05:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rikako-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{??? something good?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.88,Thought,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Minami-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.43,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, you really don't \Nhandle goodbyes well, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.39,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I hate feeling lonely. \NWhat about you, Listhy?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.60,0:05:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know if I like it or not, \Nbut I don't think I like being lonely either.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.54,0:05:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I really love the Sazanami dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.64,0:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is so kind. I wish we could all keep living together happily forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday everyone will leave Sazanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.85,0:06:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if lots of things change little by little, I think there are some things that never change. Don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.09,0:06:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I think you're right, Listhy...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.09,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But still...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.66,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tears don't suit you, Chika. \NI like your smile much better.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.53,0:06:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want everyone to leave... {to be separated from }
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish things could stay like this forever...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! It's snowing, Kengo-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.66,0:06:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's so cold. \NIt'd be nice if we had a white Christmas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.99,0:06:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It really would.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.07,0:06:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.82,0:06:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.54,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be even longer before you can see everyone. {this way}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.06,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Some things are better \Nif you save them for later, don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.99,0:07:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go back to Sazanami \Nafter Kengo-san finishes his work.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxi!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.29,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.40,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.71,0:07:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.78,0:07:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you look really pale.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.76,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.68,0:07:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Listhy, aren't you taking \Ntoo much medicine?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No. That's the proper dose for combat mode.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Combat mode?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... sorry... don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.25,0:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.21,0:07:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time it's happened. \NI still have to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.88,0:07:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.04,0:07:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{???}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.70,0:08:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand here and watch you suffer. \NSo let me do something to help.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.72,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.20,0:08:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.46,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.99,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, that's my dirty place...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.17,0:12:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.23,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, I'm... embarrassed...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.65,0:12:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let it all out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.99,0:12:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.79,0:12:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.40,0:12:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, what are you doing up this late?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.07,0:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... just something.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.00,0:12:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... no, never mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.61,0:12:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.75,0:13:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.78,0:13:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, no! Trade secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.66,0:13:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to see it even more!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.82,0:13:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! What do we have here?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.08,0:13:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... what's this, Kosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.82,0:13:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... it's my menu journal. \NEveryone's tastes are so different...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.95,0:13:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Writing it all down in a notebook \Nmakes it easier to keep track.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.47,0:13:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow... so detailed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always liked keeping records like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.17,0:13:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke... you've been looking \Nafter all of us this whole time?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.48,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.45,0:13:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...? Kosuke... "the last meal"? {/final}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.98,0:13:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kanna-san's coming back, \Ndoes that mean you're quitting as manager?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving? You can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.60,0:13:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only filling in for Kanna-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.12,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, it'll be painful for me \Nto say goodbye to everyone too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.36,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.39,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But just because I'm not the manager anymore \Ndoesn't mean we'll never see each other again.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Hey, Kosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.66,0:14:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you, Keigo-san, and Kanna-san \Nall ran this dormitory together? {as 3 managers}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.58,0:14:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that work? \NI thought it was a pretty good idea...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.82,0:14:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... what's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A present.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A present?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.69,0:14:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. A Christmas present.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.26,0:14:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy, open it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.04,0:14:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.33,0:14:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,An M Reader... {?????????? no clue what that could be; was "A Memory Reader!" in subdesu}{going by her pills on episode 4, keep it as M}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.79,0:14:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What, don't you like it, kid? {bouzu - as if listhy was a boy}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.60,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mayuki... how did you know \Nthis was exactly what I wanted?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't hard to figure out. \NYou remind me of how Chika used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.94,0:14:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.47,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've got a meeting to get to. \NI'll be back before tonight's Christmas party.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.12,0:15:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.92,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.72,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... well, thank you for this. \NI'm really happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.87,0:15:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a good look on you. {lit: good face}\NWell, see you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.65,0:15:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your visit!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.49,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki really is amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.35,0:15:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.99,0:15:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have abilities like ours, \Nbut it's almost like she can read people's hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.04,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right. But maybe everybody out there has some kind of special ability.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.83,0:15:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.05,0:15:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.83,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.46,0:15:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.64,0:15:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks just like you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.93,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20, hand over TE-1 to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.64,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray, no one here goes by a number!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.07,0:15:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.57,0:16:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Silver Ray looks exactly like you...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.79,0:16:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this! I'm sick of all of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.97,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hating it won't change anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.16,0:16:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.95,0:16:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.45,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.08,0:16:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we escaped, people would just think \Nwe're monsters and lock us away.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.88,0:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.91,0:16:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you think there's someone \Nout there who'd accept us?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such person.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where we belong.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.11,0:16:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere else for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.67,0:16:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so... I want to go somewhere! \NAnywhere but here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd rather become a doll.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray, Listhy, Stop it already, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.78,0:17:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.06,0:17:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.59,0:17:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,stop resisting and hand over TE-1. \NOtherwise, you'll lose your life!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.51,0:17:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My present from Mayuki... how dare you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance. Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk... such recklessness.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.12,0:18:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.07,0:18:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll protect you, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.13,0:18:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent, Silver Ray!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.28,0:18:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've surpassed LC-20!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.30,0:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we add the T1 genes... \Njust imagine the monster we'll be able to create!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.95,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'm okay now.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.04,0:18:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.78,0:19:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's waiting for me. \NI have to do this.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.35,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.57,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20! TE-1! Come out! \NI know you're here!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.58,0:19:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.36,0:19:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.42,0:19:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.47,0:19:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Silver Ray! Let's settle this! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.39,0:19:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow. Such a sloppy attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.11,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20, stop running and fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.74,0:19:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of chasing you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.08,0:19:43.20,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've got to get her as far away \Nfrom Chika as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.83,0:19:47.83,Thought,,0,0,0,,Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.80,0:19:53.30,Thought,,0,0,0,,She was created from my genetic template — a composite clone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.28,Thought,,0,0,0,,You could call her my little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.13,Thought,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.49,0:20:02.51,Thought,,0,0,0,,I was born... no, created, \Nin a laboratory as a living weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.16,0:20:07.96,Thought,,0,0,0,,They trained me to use my abilities \Nto destroy things efficiently and to kill people.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.96,0:20:17.33,Thought,,0,0,0,,For that purpose, I was sent all over the world — Africa, the Middle East, the Balkans, Central Asia...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.04,0:20:23.34,Thought,,0,0,0,,When I was left broken like a discarded rag, \Nan organization rescued me. {another from the one that created her}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.85,Thought,,0,0,0,,Keigo-san's organization...?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.85,0:20:31.15,Thought,,0,0,0,,Yes. Since then, I've worked with them \Nto stop other living weapons like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.15,0:20:32.57,Thought,,0,0,0,,Stop them...?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.57,0:20:38.98,Thought,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Keigo told me to protect you, Chika... \Nbut I dragged you into this anyway. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.14,Thought,,0,0,0,,Listhy...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20, this is the end!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.45,0:21:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.23,0:21:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,T1!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.15,0:21:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, stay back!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.37,0:21:43.45,Thought,,0,0,0,,What incredible power... \NWhere is it coming from?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.45,0:21:49.58,Thought,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray, I won't let you have Chika... \Neven if it costs me my life!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.34,0:22:00.09,Thought,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, Mayuki, Minami, Kaoru, Izayoi, Mio, Kaede, Yuuhi, Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.09,0:22:03.26,Thought,,0,0,0,,I wanted to spend more time with all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.57,0:22:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Listhy! Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.94,0:22:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, she's not human. \NShe's a living weapon that tried to kill you!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.32,0:22:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No... she is human. Same way you do, \Nshe can feel sadness and loneliness, just like I can!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.42,0:22:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not the same as you, Chika!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.20,0:22:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are! Because she — \Nand the Listhy inside her — were crying! {??? probably implying she has a listy living inside her too, but suppressed?}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.57,0:22:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you say goodbye?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.26,0:22:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.82,0:22:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were sad, weren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.26,0:22:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you wanted to stay with everyone, \Nbecause you didn't want to leave!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.89,0:22:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.84,0:22:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,LC-20...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.40,0:22:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and kill me. \NThat's your mission, isn't it? Do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:58.18,0:23:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die! You must live.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if people reject you, \Neven if they push you away,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:03.38,0:23:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,if you stay alive, someday you'll meet someone \Nwho'll make you glad you did!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.76,0:23:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll find a place where you belong!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.16,0:23:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What naive nonsense.\N LC-20, put me out of my misery!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.04,0:23:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You of all people should understand. \NThere's no point in me living like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.35,0:23:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.73,0:23:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.72,0:23:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.51,0:23:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Listhy!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:37.69,0:23:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.21,0:23:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.62,0:23:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,T1... Why did you save me?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.50,0:23:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how you're born, no matter what you look like, everyone deserves to be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.52,0:23:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on living!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.71,0:24:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're together, \NI'm sure we can find happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.23,0:24:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Listhy?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.68,0:24:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.51,0:24:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like back then...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.97,0:24:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Chika.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.73,0:24:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go outside together.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.05,0:24:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray! What happened? Answer me!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:45.96,0:24:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.52,0:24:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryu Hakuei of the Ryu Organization, I presume? {ryuu means dragon}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.20,0:24:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for violating the Medical Practices Act and the Genetic Protection Act.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.97,0:25:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Government dogs... {inu me}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.57,0:25:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me a dog if you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.00,0:25:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means I get to sink my teeth into scum who toy with people's lives and hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.33,0:25:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.92,0:25:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.09,0:25:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Silver Ray?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:21.87,0:25:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she's still alive. \NBut don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:25.38,0:25:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Ray will never attack Chika again.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:31.56,0:25:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Yes. Good work. \NThe operation is over.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.59,0:25:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy, we made it in time for the Christmas party. See you later, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.15,0:25:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:44.90,0:25:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's head home.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.50,0:25:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.34,0:26:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:04.38,0:26:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the party's in full swing, \NNimura Mayuki will perform a song!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.43,0:26:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.14,0:26:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayu, are you sure \Nyour manuscript's going to be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.08,0:26:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about that too.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.24,0:26:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I was doing a great job \Nof forgetting about it until you reminded me!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.76,0:26:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use us to vent your anger on!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:21.68,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously. We were only trying to be nice...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:24.38,0:26:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice? That was pure malice!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.03,0:26:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki, you're acting like a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:27.94,0:26:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pipe down! Ah... Kosuke!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.71,0:26:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.64,0:26:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the outfit? \NGoing somewhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:36.02,0:26:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So you found me.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.73,0:26:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to leave \Nwithout everyone noticing.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.77,0:26:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave? Leave for where?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.14,0:26:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagasaki. Kanna-san's back, \Nso my temporary job is over, right? {part time}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:48.02,0:26:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt both long and short... \Nbut I'm really glad I got to meet all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:52.80,0:26:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget Sazanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right... Kanna-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.31,0:27:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the journal I kept the whole time \NI was here. I'd like you to have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:07.96,0:27:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did live up \Nto my expectations, Kosuke-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You took wonderful care of everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.28,0:27:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. I'm giving it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.74,0:27:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:27:18.64,0:27:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, Kosuke-chan is full-time manager. {/official}\NI trust you to keep taking good care of everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.14,0:27:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You trust me... \Nthen what are you going to do, Kanna-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:25.87,0:27:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:28.42,0:27:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a good wife for Keigo-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:40.48,0:27:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Kanna-san! \NCongratulations, Keigo-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:42.88,0:27:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:44.08,0:27:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you were getting married, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:46.89,0:27:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We never imagined it would be to Keigo-sama!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.71,0:27:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.96,0:27:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:52.56,0:27:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? For what?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.32,0:27:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "for what?"
Dialogue: 10,0:27:55.72,0:27:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.75,0:27:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:27:57.17,0:28:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this wonderful? \NYou've got a new mom now.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.12,0:28:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna is Kanna. \NShe's not my mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:04.88,0:28:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But that mom is Kanna-san. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:07.44,0:28:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh! No, Minami, that's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.84,0:28:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Mio. Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.70,0:28:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Let go, Kanna! This is gross!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:15.56,0:28:17.21,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You're adorable when embarrassed!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.21,0:28:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not embarrassed!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:20.84,0:28:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Listhy?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.43,0:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:23.99,0:28:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... the mission's over, \Nso we'd better head out.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:28.81,0:28:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like you want to.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.03,0:28:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt like this before. \NFor the first time, I want to disobey my orders.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.81,0:28:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:36.78,0:28:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:37.63,0:28:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've finally found it...\NThe place you always wanted to reach.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.79,0:28:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going back to?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:45.50,0:28:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you leave us behind \Nand call somewhere else home?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.14,0:28:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:50.31,0:28:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Home is wherever there are people \Nwaiting to say, "Welcome back."
Dialogue: 10,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if I stay here?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:04.56,0:29:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay together forever!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:06.19,0:29:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! To celebrate, Shina Yuuhi's gonna sing!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:10.66,0:29:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:29:11.79,0:29:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuuhi-chan, can I sing with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:13.94,0:29:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:15.61,0:29:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, four!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:34.55,0:29:41.82,Song,,0,0,0,,{unlike the first ending song, this doesn't seem to exist outside this ova; no lyrics found so translating by ear}We've wandered on an endless journey, \Nand before we knew it
Dialogue: 10,0:29:41.82,0:29:49.22,Song,,0,0,0,,Even when sorrow fills the sky above,
Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.22,0:29:56.22,Song,,0,0,0,,Even when your heart trembles with pain,
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.22,0:30:03.64,Song,,0,0,0,,Don't ever let the light fade from your eyes
Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.64,0:30:14.98,Song,,0,0,0,,If we're allowed, it's there — \Ncountless gentle memories we've shared together
Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.98,0:30:25.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Smiles, and all the feelings that keep piling up forever
Dialogue: 10,0:30:25.17,0:30:32.91,Song,,0,0,0,,From here on, we'll keep running ahead,
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.91,0:30:40.25,Song,,0,0,0,,toward the endless finish line \Nat the end of our long, long journey
Dialogue: 10,0:30:40.25,0:30:58.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll always hold close the days we spent here \Nand the seasons we shared our smiles
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.31,0:31:25.76,Song,,0,0,0,,The miracle and chance that brought us together,\Nthe tiny bit of courage that connected our hearts
Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.30,0:31:45.10,Song,,0,0,0,,Holding close the warmth and the voices,\Nthat mark the beginning of a new day
Dialogue: 10,0:31:45.10,0:31:51.87,Song,,0,0,0,,Looking up at the distant sky,\Nremembering the same memories
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.87,0:32:04.65,Song,,0,0,0,,It's okay, they're always engraved in my heart,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:04.65,0:32:07.07,Song,,0,0,0,,kindness and tears...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:07.07,0:32:15.10,Song,,0,0,0,,See? They'll become a strength nothing can defeat
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.10,0:32:23.08,Song,,0,0,0,,From now on,\Nwe'll keep running forward forever
Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.08,0:32:30.14,Song,,0,0,0,,Our long, long journey, and we're standing now on the starting line
Dialogue: 10,0:32:30.14,0:32:48.68,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll always hold close the days we spent here \Nand the seasons we shared our smiles
Dialogue: 10,0:33:03.89,0:33:08.26,Thought,,0,0,0,,Even if someday we have \Nto go our separate ways,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.26,0:33:13.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,as long as there's a place where someone's waiting to greet us with a smile and say, "Welcome back..."
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.77,0:33:17.76,Thought,,0,0,0,,That's the place I love most.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:19.17,0:33:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
